WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.621
Hi guys, my name is Alini.
大家好，我叫阿利尼。

00:00:03.621 --> 00:00:07.600
I'm from Brazil and I've been a fan of the show for a few years now.
我来自巴西，几年来我一直是这个节目的粉丝。

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:10.011
I first started watching when I was 16.
我第一次开始看是在我16岁的时候。

00:00:10.011 --> 00:00:19.100
It was my senior year of high school and at the time I was having a lot of fear and anxiety because I had no idea what I wanted to do with my life.
那是我高中四年级，当时我有很多恐惧和焦虑，因为我不知道自己想做什么。

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:31.100
I didn't know what profession I wanted or what college and the show really helped me to understand that not only my feelings were valid but also that I could trust myself.
我不知道自己想要什么职业，也不知道什么大学，而这个节目真正帮助我明白，我的感受不仅是正确的，而且我可以相信自己。

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.460
and that I should trust the process that eventually things were going to work out.
我应该相信事情最终会解决的过程。

00:00:35.179 --> 00:00:36.013
And now I'm 24.
现在我24岁了。

00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:43.900
I'm a psychologist and I'm studying to get into residency, which has given me a lot of the same viewing reading thoughts that I had back then.
我是一名心理学家，正在学习成为住院医生，这给了我很多与当时相同的观看阅读想法。

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:50.162
And rewatching the show because of the podcast is really helping me through it again.
由于播客而重新观看该节目确实帮助我再次度过了难关。

00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:51.551
So thank you so much.
非常感谢。

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:58.100
Thanks for the great advice and thanks for always being that show that's there when I need comfort.
感谢您提供的宝贵建议，也感谢您在我需要安慰时始终出现在我身边。

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:22.049
Welcome, welcome back to How We Made Your Mother.
欢迎，欢迎回到《我们如何创造了你的母亲》。

00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:23.049
I'm Josh Radner.
我是乔什·拉德纳。

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.129
I am joined by my friend Craig Thomas.
我的朋友克雷格·托马斯也加入了我的行列。

00:01:25.129 --> 00:01:26.129
Hello, Craig.
你好，克雷格。

00:01:26.129 --> 00:01:27.129
Hey, Josh.
嘿，乔什。

00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:28.129
Very happy to be with you.
很高兴和你在一起。

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:35.530
co-created a show called How I Met Your Mother with Carter Bayes that ran on CBS from 2005 to 2014.
2005 年至 2014 年，与卡特·贝叶斯 (Carter Bayes) 共同创作了哥伦比亚广播公司 (CBS) 播出的节目《老爸老妈的浪漫史》(How I Met Your Mother)。

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.090
I played Ted Mosby on that show.
我在那场演出中扮演泰德·莫斯比。

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:40.090
And we are doing a deep dive.
我们正在深入研究。

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.569
We're revisiting the show.
我们正在重温这个节目。

00:01:41.569 --> 00:01:45.689
All these many years later, we are discovering gems.
这么多年过去了，我们不断发现宝石。

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:48.769
We're discovering things we would have done different.
我们正在发现一些我们本来会做的不同的事情。

00:01:48.769 --> 00:01:57.250
We're interrogating the mystery of why people from Brazil and all over the world continue to love this show.
我们正在探究为什么巴西和世界各地的人们继续喜爱这个节目的谜团。

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:05.709
I will say that Ben Lee and I, as Radner and Lee, we toured Brazil in 2017, I think.
我想说，我想，Ben Lee 和我，作为 Radner 和 Lee，我们在 2017 年游览了巴西。

00:02:05.709 --> 00:02:06.549
That's so cool.
太酷了。

00:02:06.549 --> 00:02:09.189
I don't think I ever, yeah, tell that story.
是的，我想我从来没有讲过这个故事。

00:02:09.189 --> 00:02:14.629
It was the first time I really, I really learned that Brazilians love how I met your mother.
这是我第一次真正了解到巴西人喜欢我与你母亲的相遇。

00:02:14.629 --> 00:02:18.270
How I met your mother is huge, demonstrably huge in Brazil.
我是如何认识你母亲的，这对巴西来说意义非凡。

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.389
