感觉这是一部安慰剧，但也是一部进步的剧。

00:04:18.672 --> 00:04:19.627
It is about time.
是时候了。

00:04:19.627 --> 00:04:20.863
It is about evolution.
这是关于进化的。

00:04:20.863 --> 00:04:22.829
It is about becoming a perspective.
这是关于成为一种观点。

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:30.104
The way we frame our life, the way we become aware that our life is a story that moves forward and we get to shape that narrative to some extent.
我们构建生活的方式，我们意识到我们的生活是一个不断前进的故事的方式，我们在某种程度上塑造了这个故事。

00:04:30.104 --> 00:04:35.071
I love that part of her message just that she said it helped her in these moments of making a leap.
我喜欢她的信息中的这一部分，因为她说这在她实现飞跃的时刻帮助了她。

00:04:35.071 --> 00:04:39.837
And the fact that congratulations that you made this leap to this new career, that's wonderful.
祝贺您实现了新职业的飞跃，这真是太棒了。

00:04:39.837 --> 00:04:42.144
I'm so glad the show is there for you at time.
我很高兴这部剧能及时出现在你面前。

00:04:42.144 --> 00:04:45.355
It's also interesting to interrogate the idea of a comfort show.
质疑安慰秀的想法也很有趣。

00:04:45.355 --> 00:04:49.670
The fact that that how I met your mother, we hear it so much, is comforting to people.
事实上，我们经常听到我是如何遇见你母亲的，这让人们感到安慰。

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:52.509
Doesn't mean that the characters on the show are comfortable all the time.
并不意味着剧中的角色一直都很舒服。

00:04:52.509 --> 00:04:55.870
In fact, the characters on the show are in deep discomfort a lot.
事实上，剧中的人物都处于深深的不适之中。

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:56.790
They're mostly uncomfortable.
他们大多感到不舒服。

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.269
They're mostly uncomfortable.
他们大多感到不舒服。

00:04:58.269 --> 00:05:16.050
But what I think is comforting about it is that notion of perspective, is that notion of family and community being there alongside of you and knowing that in your discomfort, you, on the other side of that discomfort might be the life you're really longing for.
但我认为令人欣慰的是这种观点的概念，是家庭和社区在你身边的概念，并且知道在你的不适中，在不适的另一边的你可能是你真正渴望的生活。

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.769
Yeah, it's not a show of stasis.
是的，这不是停滞的表现。

00:05:17.769 --> 00:05:18.610
No.
不。

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.649
The comfort of the show is not in stasis.
节目的舒适感并不是停滞不前的。

00:05:20.649 --> 00:05:27.569
The comfort of the show, I think, is look at how fucked up all these people are, too, just like how I'm feeling fucked up.
我认为，这部剧的安慰之处就在于看看这些人也都搞砸了，就像我也感觉搞砸了一样。

00:05:27.569 --> 00:05:34.209
And there's something about the flaws and the vulnerability of these characters that I think is comforting, even though it's a mess in a way, too.
我认为这些角色的缺陷和脆弱性令人欣慰，尽管在某种程度上也很混乱。

00:05:34.209 --> 00:05:46.649
It's almost like when you get to know someone you're really inspired by that you really think, like, has either a career that's enviable or a family life Or just a person in the world that you look at from afar and go, they've really figured something out.
这几乎就像当你认识一个你真正受到启发的人时，你真的认为，比如，拥有令人羡慕的职业或家庭生活，或者只是世界上一个你远远地看着然后走的人，他们真的想出了一些办法。

00:05:46.649 --> 00:05:59.329
