And I think that respecting the intelligence of the viewer and not leading them in a way that was insulting, but you know, like Billy Wilder said, like letting them put two and two together, I think that's part of the pleasure of the show, especially for repeat viewings.
我认为尊重观众的智慧，不要以一种侮辱性的方式引导他们，但你知道，就像比利·怀尔德说的那样，就像让他们把两个和两个放在一起，我认为这是这部剧的乐趣的一部分，特别是对于重复观看来说。

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.740
Yeah, yeah, I hope so.
是啊是啊，我希望如此。

