I'm surprised that we did it this early in season two because we probably, I bet the network would have preferred we did an episode where Barney was less evil than this episode, David, just to be like, let's get more people in and liking everybody.
我很惊讶我们在第二季的早期就这样做了，因为我们可能，我打赌网络会更喜欢我们做一集，其中巴尼比这一集不那么邪恶，大卫，只是为了让更多的人加入并喜欢每个人。

00:16:45.202 --> 00:16:51.049
But I think the episode, it has this kind of tension and it's funny because we went to start with Barney.
但我认为这一集有这种紧张感，很有趣，因为我们从巴尼开始。

00:16:51.049 --> 00:16:54.094
And I think he can't stop himself at this moment.
而且我认为他此刻无法阻止自己。

00:16:54.094 --> 00:17:00.306
Through the long arc of the entire series, you see Barney try to be better than this at other times.
通过整个系列的长弧线，你会看到巴尼在其他时候试图做得比这更好。

